5Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":3,"created_at":"2026-07-07T08:26:39Z","updated_at":"2026-07-24T14:28:29Z","closed_at":"2026-07-24T14:25:32Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.6.3.stable, 4.7.stable, 4.8.dev1\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.8.dev1 - macOS Sequoia (15.7.5) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Metal (Mobile) - integrated Apple M2 Max (Apple8) - Apple M2 Max (12 threads) - 64.00 GiB memory - CoreAudio (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\nAndroid 16.0 (arm64) on Android Emulator\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen I run a project with `display/window/frame_pacing/android/enable_frame_pacing` enabled on the Android Emulator on macOS, it outputs an error and the screen does not display.\n```\nE 0:00:01:432   command_queue_execute_and_present: Couldn't present to Vulkan queue (VkResult error 5).\n  <C++ Error>     Condition \"err != VK_SUCCESS && err != VK_SUBOPTIMAL_KHR\" is true. Returning: FAILED\n  <C++ Source>     drivers/vulkan/rendering_device_driver_vulkan.cpp:3359 @ command_queue_execute_and_present()\n```\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open MRP\n2. Export the project\n3. Install the exported APK file on a virtual device running the Android Emulator and run it\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[android-emulator-swappy-mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/29736399/android-emulator-swappy-mrp.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/fol